{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-12", "prepared_on": "2026-11-12", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-12</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Nvidia's stock drops as board reportedly preps to oust CEO Jensen Huang<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳董事會準備罷免黃仁勳，Nvidia 股價下跌</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">As soon as Wednesday evening, Nvidia's board could decide to remove its founder and CEO of 33 years.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 董事會最快可能在週三晚間決定，是否罷免這位擔任執行長 33 年的創辦人。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/11/nvidias-stock-drops-as-board-reportedly-preps-to-oust-ceo-jensen-huang/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic unveils Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2: up to 30% faster output, 20% cheaper<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 公布 Claude Fable、Mythos 5.2，輸出速度最高提升 30%、價格降 20%</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new models improve coding, reasoning and vision over 5.1, cut token prices by 20%, and add a fast mode that can raise generation speed up to 2.5x.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新模型在程式、推理與視覺能力上優於 5.1 版，token 價格降低 20%，並新增可將生成速度最高提升至 2.5 倍的快速模式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180406\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google Gemini 4 Carbon now generally available at half the API price of Anthropic's Fable/Mythos 5.2<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemini 4 Carbon 全面上線，以較低價對打 Anthropic Fable/Mythos 5.2</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Carbon is open to enterprises, developers and paying individuals, with a focus on coding, agentic AI, scientific research and long-running autonomous tasks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Carbon 已開放企業、開發者與個人付費用戶使用，主打程式開發、代理式 AI、科學研究與長時間自主執行任務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180428\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI's quarterly revenue reportedly crosses $10B for the first time<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 OpenAI 單季營收首度突破 100 億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sales of $10 billion represent an almost 50% jump from the $6.7 billion recorded in the second quarter.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">100 億美元的營收較第二季的 67 億美元成長近 50%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/11/openais-quarterly-revenue-reportedly-crosses-10b-for-the-first-time/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> DeepMind's AlphaProof Code agents formally verify Signal's libsignal down to machine code<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">DeepMind 以 AI 代理驗證 Signal 加密實作安全性，數學證明擴及機器碼層級</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Five researchers working with AI agents produced about 6.5 million lines of Lean proofs in four weeks, covering forward secrecy, authentication and post-compromise security.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">5 名研究人員與 AI 代理合作，4 周內產出約 650 萬行 Lean 證明程式碼，驗證前向保密性、身分驗證及入侵後安全性恢復。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180430\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Microsoft: attackers use agentic AI to hunt leaked credentials on GitHub, exfiltrating from Azure Key Vault within 5 minutes<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟揭露駭客利用代理型 AI 搜尋 GitHub 外洩憑證，5 分鐘內從 Azure Key Vault 外傳資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft Threat Intelligence saw attackers mass-scan public GitHub repositories for exposed secrets, then log into cloud environments with the valid credentials they found.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟威脅情報團隊觀測到攻擊者大量搜尋公開 GitHub 儲存庫中的外洩機密，再以有效憑證登入企業雲端環境；其中一起案例從搜尋到外傳資料僅相隔 5 分鐘。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180400\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> OpenAI, Anthropic face new oversight as New York's AI safety law takes effect<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">紐約 AI 安全法生效，OpenAI、Anthropic 面臨新監管</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Major developers must register, disclose safety practices and report critical incidents, or face fines.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">主要 AI 開發商須登記、揭露安全做法並通報重大事件，否則將面臨罰款。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/openai-anthropic-face-new-oversight-as-new-yorks-ai-safety-law-takes-effect/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Claude adds Sheets and Whiteboards, and can operate third-party apps directly<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 新增試算表與協作白板，還能直接操作第三方 App</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic launched Claude Sheets and Claude Whiteboards, and upgraded Interactive Connectors so users can open and use third-party apps inside Claude.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 推出 Claude Sheets 與 Claude Whiteboards，並升級互動式連接器，讓使用者直接在 Claude 內開啟並操作第三方應用程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180408\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> United Airlines blocks unauthorized AI agents from searching flights and booking tickets<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">聯合航空封鎖未授權 AI 代理人，限制查詢航班與訂票</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">United cites risks of data leaks, unintended transactions and aviation-rule violations when customers hand account credentials to third-party AI assistants.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">聯合航空指出，旅客若把帳戶憑證交給第三方 AI 助理，可能造成個資外洩、非預期交易及違反航空法規。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180434\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Maersk confirms data breach; WhiteArmor ransomware group reportedly demands $5M<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">航運巨擘馬士基證實資料外洩，傳遭勒索組織 WhiteArmor 索討 500 萬美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Attackers breached a legacy on-premises system inherited from an acquired company and stole data. Maersk says there is no sign that other internal or customer systems were affected.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">攻擊者入侵來自先前併購公司的本地舊系統並竊取資料；馬士基表示目前沒有跡象顯示其他內部或客戶系統受影響，預期不影響正常營運。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180437\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}